From: Fixture Author <author@example.invalid>
Date: Wed, 23 Sep 2026 23:57:53 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] [diffs] Compare diffs by cache key when finalizing a
 virtualized render (#1151)

* [diffs] Compare diffs by cache key when finalizing a virtualized render

A diff rebuilt as a new object with the same cacheKey could be prepared
with the cached object and rendered with the new one. The identity check
in finalizeRender then threw "rendered a different diff than its
prepared layout". Compare with areDiffTargetsEqual, as the rest of the
render path does.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5

* Fix race condition in test
