Subject: [PATCH 2/3] fix(diffs): align the edit caret with user-installed
 fonts in WebKit (#1133)

Open an editable file in a WKWebView or Playwright WebKit with a code
font the user installed themselves, such as Inconsolata, and select a
word: the caret and selection overlay sit a few pixels off the glyphs,
drifting further right along the line. Safari hides user-installed fonts
